          "<p>Before building anything, ask what work the users need to complete. Collect facts and break the existing system into parts to understand the problem.</p><p>That is analysis. Design then plans the components and modules that can satisfy those needs.</p><p>Keep the two questions separate when reading an exam statement. A statement about a needed result belongs to analysis. A choice about technical construction belongs to design.</p>",
