          "<table class=\"t\"><tr><th>Test</th><th>Scope</th></tr><tr><td>Unit</td><td>One module</td></tr><tr><td>Integration</td><td>Interfaces between modules</td></tr><tr><td>Regression</td><td>Existing behavior after changes</td></tr><tr><td>System</td><td>Whole system against requirements</td></tr></table><p>Beta testing puts nearly finished software in users’ hands. Acceptance testing is conducted by the owner after beta testing to check release criteria.</p><div class=\"callout warn\">A fix can break an old feature. Checking that risk is regression testing, even if the new feature passes.</div>",
