          "<p>XP uses a weekly iteration within a quarterly release. Customers choose stories; the weekly goal is running, tested features.</p><p>In pair programming the driver writes while the navigator reviews. Collective ownership lets any developer change needed code. Continuous integration merges work many times a day to expose integration problems early.</p><p>XP values communication, simplicity, feedback, respect and courage. Refactoring improves structure without changing external behavior.</p><p>Chapter videos: <a href=\"videos.html#xpscrum\">XP and Scrum</a> · <a href=\"videos.html#teams\">Teams and channels</a>.</p>",
