          "<p>The backlog lists customer wants as user stories. A <b>sprint</b> is a short development cycle aimed at delivering a working increment.</p><p>These slides describe 30-day sprints and a daily scrum of at most 15 minutes. The scrum master coordinates daily meetings and progress.</p><div class=\"callout warn\">For the blank, write “sprint”. Keep the sprint duration separate from the daily meeting’s 15-minute limit.</div>",
