          "<p><b>DET</b>: recognizable non-repeated field. Transactions use <b>FTR</b> (files referenced/updated); ILF/EIF use <b>RET</b> (record subgroups). Find the row and column:</p><table class=\"t\"><tr><th>EI: FTR / DET</th><th>1–4</th><th>5–15</th><th>16+</th></tr><tr><td>0–1</td><td>Low</td><td>Low</td><td>Average</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Low</td><td>Average</td><td>High</td></tr><tr><td>3+</td><td>Average</td><td>High</td><td>High</td></tr></table><table class=\"t\"><tr><th>EO/EQ: FTR / DET</th><th>1–5</th><th>6–19</th><th>20+</th></tr><tr><td>0–1</td><td>Low</td><td>Low</td><td>Average</td></tr><tr><td>2–3</td><td>Low</td><td>Average</td><td>High</td></tr><tr><td>4+</td><td>Average</td><td>High</td><td>High</td></tr></table><table class=\"t\"><tr><th>ILF/EIF: RET / DET</th><th>1–19</th><th>20–50</th><th>51+</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>Low</td><td>Low</td><td>Average</td></tr><tr><td>2–5</td><td>Low</td><td>Average</td><td>High</td></tr><tr><td>6+</td><td>Average</td><td>High</td><td>High</td></tr></table><p>Weather: each EI has 6 DET/1 FTR → Low; ILF has 5 DET/1 RET → Low.</p><div class=\"callout warn\">Use FTR for transactions, RET for data groups. Their DET bands differ.</div>",
