          "<p>Use these weights, then total each row of the past paper’s CRM table.</p><table class=\"t\"><tr><th>Unit</th><th>Low</th><th>Average</th><th>High</th></tr><tr><td>EI</td><td>3</td><td>4</td><td>6</td></tr><tr><td>EO</td><td>4</td><td>5</td><td>7</td></tr><tr><td>EQ</td><td>3</td><td>4</td><td>6</td></tr><tr><td>ILF</td><td>7</td><td>10</td><td>15</td></tr><tr><td>EIF</td><td>5</td><td>7</td><td>10</td></tr></table><table class=\"t\"><tr><th>CRM (2025)</th><th>Low count × weight</th><th>Average</th><th>High</th><th>Subtotal</th></tr><tr><td>EI</td><td>12×3</td><td>8×4</td><td>3×6</td><td>86</td></tr><tr><td>EO</td><td>5×4</td><td>10×5</td><td>2×7</td><td>84</td></tr><tr><td>EQ</td><td>15×3</td><td>4×4</td><td>0×6</td><td>61</td></tr><tr><td>ILF</td><td>2×7</td><td>3×10</td><td>1×15</td><td>59</td></tr><tr><td>EIF</td><td>1×5</td><td>0×7</td><td>0×10</td><td>5</td></tr></table><p><b>UFP = 86 + 84 + 61 + 59 + 5 = 295.</b> The all-low weather example gives 3×3 + 1×4 + 1×3 + 1×7 = 23.</p><div class=\"callout warn\">Add all complexity groups. A count is not yet a weighted FP subtotal.</div>",
