          "<p>A requirement states what the system must do or a property it must have. Write it in the SRS to establish shared understanding.</p><p><b>Functional:</b> display a student’s weekly schedule; send a welcome email after account creation.</p><p><b>Nonfunctional:</b> respond within six seconds under the stated workload; use Java/Eclipse; limit each menu to four functions.</p><div class=\"callout warn\">For discussion, define both types and give examples. Specific wording does not make a technology constraint functional.</div><p>Chapter videos: <a href=\"videos.html#requirements\">Requirements</a> · <a href=\"videos.html#factfinding\">Fact-finding</a>.</p>",
